      "statement": "The Commercial Entitlements Service (CES, SYS-CES) is the authorization and entitlements system of record for commercial banking users, tracking which users/clients are entitled to which accounts and entitlement types, and is rated Tier 1 (24x7 critical) in the PTT system ownership register.",
