    {
      "id": "claim_f5b950f1c45943e294b49e0edb502270",
      "statement": "CES is owned by the CBO Platform team, with Nadia Haddad as technical owner, Arjun Mehta as tech lead (also leading the CBO Status Projection Service, SPS), and Marcus Chen as business owner; CBO Platform & Entitlements' planning factor is roughly 1 point = 6.5 hours, ~30 points/sprint, intake via Jira CBO (Platform) with 2-week triage, and was ~70% committed as of PI 27.1.",
