    {
      "id": "claim_7d5ed30dde264d70a5b0ccc3b2759b3a",
      "statement": "Account-level filtering of Wire Center search/activity results to a user's entitled accounts is performed by cbo-wire-bff using CES entitlement data, not by the upstream PPH wire-list API; this combines with a PPH v1 limitation where the activity-list endpoint returns up to 500 rows per client with no server-side account filter, requiring client-side filtering (delivered as CBO-4302, R26.3).",
