    {
      "id": "claim_aeaacc72db2c4f02a94bbe73b1fe7880",
      "statement": "CES's account-filter mapping for PPH v2 search is the specific blocking dependency (tracked as story CBO-4473, 8 points, Backlog, owner Arjun Mehta) for the CBO-4471 Wire Center PPH v1-to-v2 migration epic (34 points, Backlog/unscheduled, owner Tom Becker), which must complete before the 2027-03-31 PPH v1 sunset confirmed by the ARB on 2026-09-08 with no extensions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/cbo-arch-wc-4.1-wire-center-current-state-architecture.md#L136-L138",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6908edea12e9d9d1a0e4efae1806aaeabeb8d52de6d3216b1f08194e5510a680:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/jira-export-wt-discovery-2026-10-05.md#L37-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c45e0aa9c681965a8c3db33b6f6322a741d5d160c2aa204b7d4fd53edd9c83b2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_807ad5e81d3f446ca69d7b86e7f8eee1",
      "statement": "The dependency arises because PPH v1 list (EP-PPH-02) has no server-side account filter and PPH v2 search (EP-PPH-05) filters only by clientId, not by account, so CBO-4473 must define how CES's per-user per-account entitlement data maps onto clientId-scoped v2 search for filtering to continue working after migration; as of the 2026-10-05 export both CBO-4473 and CBO-4471 remain unscheduled Backlog items, and PPH-2190 flags cbo-wire-bff as the only major PPH v1 consumer not yet started on migration.",
      "evidence": [
